Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Build joints and bodies in Blueprint authoring order

GetAttachChildren() order is rebuilt at load and differs in cooked builds
(siblings come back name-sorted), which reorders the joints inside a body
and so changes the physics. Sort children by their SCS node order before
